    {
      "id": "u_ed890ed5aa2b0558bdcb412c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There are some cases in which you may want to restore the original demo notes. For example, if you experimented with some of the more advanced features and want to see the original reference, or if you simply want to explore the latest version of the demo notes, which might showcase new features.",
      "sourceHash": "ed890ed5aa2b0558bdcb412cb202edfae980884101e4ba1aa545c34c3d49715b",
      "context": "Demo Notes > Restoring Demo Notes",
      "contextHash": "c1ca31ccc8b0b855bdc848786f817be6342b9d80538786773bb5e927e92414e0",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "元のデモノートを復元したくなる場合があります。例えば、高度な機能を試した後に元のリファレンスを確認したい場合や、新機能を紹介している可能性のある最新バージョンのデモノートを単純に確認したい場合などです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6d65b1c362d19d85ab2ee6eb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "You can easily restore the demo notes by using Trilium's built-in import feature by importing them:",
